DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261015T150000
SUMMARY:The Single Source of Truth: MDM as the Foundation for AI
DESCRIPTION:Data Science Raleigh\nAI may be flashy\, but it’s only as sm
 art as the data it learns from. And too often\, that data is fragmented\, 
 duplicated\, or just plain wrong. Master Data Management (MDM) is making a
  comeback—not as a back-office hygiene tool\, but as a strategic enabler
  for AI initiatives that need clean\, consistent\, and connected data to t
 hrive.\n\nThis webinar unpacks how modern MDM supports AI-readiness. We’
 ll explore the role of entity resolution\, governance\, and data lineage i
 n building trusted foundations—and why aligning on a “single source of
  truth” is the prerequisite to scaling AI across the enterprise.\n\n**Ke
 y Takeaways:**\n\n1️⃣ **Why MDM Matters Now:** The renewed importance 
 of core data quality and consistency in AI workflows.\n\n2️⃣ **From Si
 loed to Unified:** Techniques for resolving identities\, linking records\,
  and creating authoritative views of customers\, products\, and more.\n\n3
 ️⃣ **AI-Ready Data Design:** How to structure and steward data so it
 ’s not just usable—but reliable and traceable for machine learning.\n\
 n4️⃣ **Governance in Practice:** Embedding data ownership\, validation
 \, and versioning into the AI development lifecycle.\n\n**[Register here](
 https://hubs.ly/Q04jJm4F0)**
